; PC-F47 (S15 head, October 25, 2026): the hover panel. Godot's default
; TooltipPanel is translucent over the map (the war card's peace table read
; with "Papal States" and "Sardinia" showing through it at 1080p); this one is
; OPAQUE — the popup panel's own fill (`incoming_proposal_popup.tscn`) under
